urname>Gesemann</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiquet</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruegg</surname><given-names>M.A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Agrin binds to the nerve&#x02013;muscle basal lamina via laminin</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol</source><volume>137</volume><year>1997</year><fpage>671</fpage><lpage>683</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9151673</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Duclosetal1998a"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Duclos</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Broux</surname><given-names>O.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bourg</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Straub</surname><given-names>V.</given-names></name><name><surname>Feldman</surname><given-names>G.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sunada</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lim</surname><given-names>L.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Piccolo</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Cutshall</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Gary</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>&#x003b2;-Sarcoglycangenomic analysis and identification of a novel missense mutation in the LGMD2E Amish isolate</article-title><source>Neuromuscul. Disord</source><volume>8</volume><year>1998</year><fpage>30</fpage><lpage>38</lpage>a<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9565988</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Duclosetal1998b"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Duclos</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Straub</surname><given-names>V.</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>S.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Venzke</surname><given-names>D.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hrstka</surname><given-names>R.F.</given-names>